    "https://vcujobs.com/jobs/adjunct-honors-college-topics-vcu-main-campus-virginia-united-states": {
      "title": "Adjunct- Honors College : Topics",
      "description": "Adjunct- Honors College : Topics - VCU Main Campus, Virginia, United States Adjunct- Honors College : Topics - VCU Main Campus, Virginia, United States Search Jobs Applicant Login Settings Kiosk mode Ready to join a workforce UN LIKE any other? Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Adjunct- Honors College : Topics 45001603 907 Floyd Avenue, VCU Main Campus, Virginia, United States, 23284 Faculty Adjunct Honors College Advertising Summary: The Honors College at Virginia Commonwealth University (VCU) is seeking applicants to teach 3-credit undergraduate courses. Proposals in the liberal arts, humanities, the natural and social sciences, as well as interdisciplinary topics are highly desired. Unit: Honors College Department: Honors College Department Summary: The VCU Honors College is an inclusive community of scholars that inspires creativity, enduring curiosity and a commitment to improve the human experience. Duties & Responsibilities: Position Overview The Honors College at Virginia Commonwealth University is recruiting applicants for teaching adjunct faculty positions for topics courses. Position duties include: • Facilitate the course objectives. • Meet all designated course instruction guidelines. • Grade assignments and exams in a timely manner based on instructions/rubric provided. • Respond to student inquiries within 24 hours. • Submit final grades according to College/Department policy. Qualifications: Minimum Qualifications Required Qualifications • Demonstrated experience working in and fostering an environment of respect, professionalism, and civility with a population of faculty, staff, and students from various backgrounds and experiences, or a commitment to do so as a staff member at VCU. • A master’s degree with 18 graduate semester hours of coursework in a relevant discipline specific to the course topic proposed. Salary Range: $2,316 Benefits : All full-time university staff are eligible for VCU’s robust benefits package that includes comprehensive health benefits, paid annual and holiday leave granted up front, generous tuition benefits, retirement planning and savings options, tax-deferred annuity and cash match programs, employee discounts, well-being resources, abundant opportunities for career development and advancement, and more. FLSA Exemption Status: Exempt Hours per Week: 13.82 Restricted Position: No ORP Eligible: No Flexible Work Arrangement: Fully Onsite University Job Title: Rank: Instructor Tenure: Ineligible Contact Information: Contact Name: Jacqueline Smith-Mason Contact Email: jsmithmason@vcu.edu Apply now! Start by sharing your name and email, then proceed to the rest of your application. First Name (required) 4b738f3b Last Name (required) c16034d9 Email (required) 971da1e8 Apply Now Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting contact information through this form, you acknowledge that you are willing to receive recruitment-related messages such as Job Alerts and recruiter outreach from Virginia Commonwealth University. You may opt-out at any time. Thanks! We're looking forward to receiving your application soon. Send to someone else Submit information for your referral: b8aaee51 First Name (required) 42d60034 Last Name (required) 8258e7aa Email (required) 80a35766 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting contact information through this form, you acknowledge that you are willing to receive recruitment-related messages such as Job Alerts and recruiter outreach from Virginia Commonwealth University. You may opt-out at any time. Thank you for sharing this job! Recommended for you Digital Accessibility Administrator MCV Main Campus. VCU Main Campus MCV Main Campus. VCU Main Campus Unit: Office Of The Provost MBU Department: Academic Operations Duties & Responsibilities: Reporting to Academic Operations within the Office of the Provost and working closely with multiple campus partners, the Digital Accessibility Administra... Senior R